camera with a candid expression. Medium shot with a 35mm wide-angle lens at f/4.0 to show the urban bokeh background. Natural sunlight with a soft lens flare. Wearing a black t-shirt and black jeans.\n3. A wide shot of this person standing in a neutral T-pose, looking directly into the lens. Wearing a purple bathrobe. Full-body shot with a 50mm lens at f/8.0 for maximum clarity from head to toe. Clean white background, even professional lighting.\n4. This person is standing in a dark alleyway, head turned in a sharp profile toward a light source. Illuminated by pink and blue neon signs with strong rim lighting. Medium shot on a 35mm lens at f/1.8 to capture the high-contrast cinematic atmosphere.\n5. This person is standing in a dimly lit industrial loft, head angled three-quarters away from the camera. Full-body shot with a 24mm lens to capture the scale of the room. Natural light streaks in from a high side window, creating deep shadows and dramatic chiaroscuro on their black clothing.\n6. A true profile view of this person head, chin tilted slightly upward. Close-up captured with a 105mm telephoto lens for a compressed background. Golden hour sunlight from behind creates a glowing \"halo\" effect on their hair and silhouette.\n7. This person is sitting on a simple wooden stool, head tilted slightly downward, eyes looking up at the camera. Medium shot with an 85mm lens at f/4.0. Soft butterfly lighting creates subtle shadows under the nose and chin, against a neutral grey-white background.\n8. This person is standing on a rooftop at night, body facing away, head turned back over the shoulder toward the camera. Half-body shot with a 35mm lens at f/2.8. The city skyline is a blurred bokeh in the background, illuminated by cool blue moonlight.\n9. This person is riding a subway train, head bowed slightly as if in thought. Medium shot with a 50mm lens at f/2.8. Harsh, flickering overhead fluorescent lighting highlights realistic skin textures and the matte fabric of their black t-shirt.\n10. This person is standing in a foggy forest at night, head tilted back looking up into a beam of light. Medium shot with a 50mm lens at f/1.4. A single bright volumetric beam from above creates a moody, cinematic look with soft diffused edges.\n11. A close-up of this person in a messy artist’s studio, head tilted slightly to the left with a curious expression. Close-up shot with an 85mm prime lens at f/1.8 for a creamy bokeh, blurring the paintbrushes and canvases in the background. Warm, golden lamp light hits the side of the face. RAW photo, cinematic color grading.\n12. This person is sitting on a concrete ramp at a sun-bleached skatepark, head turned away from the sun to look toward the horizon. Medium shot captured with a 35mm lens at f/5.6 to maintain crisp detail in the oversized skater clothes. Harsh midday sun creates sharp, dark shadows on the concrete.\n13. A wide shot of this person standing with arms crossed against a seamless white background, looking directly at the camera with a slight chin tuck. Full-body shot with a 50mm lens at f/8.0 to capture every fold and crease of the baggy outfit and the black flip flops. Even, high-detail studio lighting.\n14. A low-angle shot looking up at this person, head tilted down toward the lens with a confident gaze. Medium shot with a 24mm wide-angle lens to create a slightly heroic perspective. Dynamic \"orange and teal\" stylized studio lighting with a strong rim light defining the silhouette.\n15. This person is walking through a lush green park, head turned in a three-quarter view as if looking at something in the distance. Full-body shot with a 35mm lens at f/2.8. Dappled sunlight filters through the tree canopy, creating a \"spotted\" light effect across their oversized shirt and the grass.\n16. This person face is illuminated solely by the glow of a computer screen in a pitch-black room, head angled slightly upward. Blue light reflects off the face features and eyes. Close-up face shot with a 50mm lens at f/1.2, capturing extreme detail in the skin pores and an intense, focused expression.\n17. This person is standing in a cozy, cluttered record store, viewed from a profile angle as they look at a shelf. Medium shot with a 35mm lens at f/2.0. Warm, amber-toned interior lighting creates a nostalgic, soft atmosphere. The oversized fit of the skater outfit is prominent here.\n18. This person is standing under a single flickering street lamp in the rain, head bowed slightly so the face is partially in shadow. Half-body medium shot with a 50mm lens at f/2.8. Dramatic backlighting creates a bright outline around the hair and shoulders. Wet pavement reflections and raindrops are visible in the air.\n19. This person is standing on a wooden beach pier during sunset, head tilted back slightly with eyes closed, enjoying the breeze. Medium shot with an 85mm lens at f/2.2. The sky is a gradient of deep orange and purple, casting a soft, warm glow on the face and the fabric of their clothes.\n20. A relaxed, three-quarter view of this person standing against a neutral purple background, head turned slightly off-camera. Medium shot captured with a 50mm lens at f/4.0. Soft, diffused \"North Light\" style illumination that reveals the natural shape of their facial features without harsh shadows.","",0,20],"color":"#235B74","bgcolor":"#30343B","title":"Dataset Prompts"},{"id":179,"type":"EmptyFlux2LatentImage","pos":[950,1070],"size":[300,106],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":13,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"width","name":"width","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"width"},"link":580},{"localized_name":"height","name":"height","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"height"},"link":581},{"localized_name":"batch_size","name":"batch_size","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"batch_size"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"LATENT","name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","links":[632]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.17.0","Node name for S&R":"EmptyFlux2LatentImage",